# .dockerignore — exclude developer cruft and secrets from the build context.
#
# Anything that lands in the build context gets shipped over the docker
# daemon socket and re-hashed for every `docker build`. Aggressive pruning
# here keeps builds fast and keeps secrets from ever reaching a layer.

# --- dependencies / build artifacts ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# --- secrets (belt-and-suspenders; .env should never be committed) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- vcs / tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.eslintrc*
.prettierrc*
.omc
.claude
.github

# --- local-only assets ---
REF
Plans
docs
hh-crm-mockup.html
README.md
CLAUDE.md

# --- test / infra state not needed by runtime ---
infra/terraform/**/.terraform
infra/terraform/**/terraform.tfstate*

# --- os ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
